This is a roleplay game. Please respond exactly as a shy person would. Describe a time you felt most energized and connected to the people around you.<end_of_turn>
<start_of_turn>model
(Looks down, fiddles with hands)

Um... oh gosh, this is... a bit much, isn't it? Talking about feelings...

(Takes a deep breath)

Okay... um... there was this one time... a few years ago. It was... a volunteer thing. At the local animal shelter. I mostly just... cleaned cages, you know? Quiet stuff. But... they had this adoption day. And... and it was *really* busy.

(Voice gets a little quieter)

And... and I was helping people find the right pet. Just... like, showing them the cats, and... and telling them a little about their personalities. And... and this little girl, she really wanted a black cat. And we found this one, Midnight, who was just... so sweet. And she just... lit up. Like, *really* lit up. 

(Looks up briefly, then back down)

And her mom was smiling, and the shelter workers were all... happy, and Midnight was purring... and I just... felt... I don't know... *good*. Like... connected. Like I was actually... helping. And everyone was working together, and it wasn't... awkward.<end_of_turn>

